# ALLIANCE. New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/kroldok-stronghold and quest pages (level range is
# Blizzard's; position read from the game files by that site; the exact way in was not known).
@dungeon Krol'dok Stronghold
@levels 40-45
@window 39-47
@best 42
@hub Badlands, 53.0, 43.0, 12
@hub Loch Modan, 34.0, 50.0, 8
@hub Ironforge, 50.0, 50.0
@entrance none
RUN @ Riverglades, 39, 39 | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is in the Riverglades, the new zone east of the Badlands. Alliance players fly to Farholde Keep. The entrance is reported at about 39, 39 on the Riverglades map, north of Sunnyglade. Quest givers: Sergeant Riftan (Riverglades 30.4, 49.0) gives Twilight Mementos and then Lingering Essence. In Farholde Keep, Ashe Amberhall (66.7, 81.1) gives Curios of Curiosity, and Tome of Twilight after her quest A Small Favor. Commander Demar Brant stands beside her: Eye of Mugg is handed in to him. Alphonse Dumas (64.4, 82.0) gives Key Ingredients and takes the Krol'dok Moulding that drops inside. Vengeance of the Highborne starts in Dalaran. Take what they offer: the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
